<title>INDIA: HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>HOCKEY-WOMEN'S INDIRA GANDHI GOLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the Indira Gandhi</p>
<p>Gold Cup women's hockey tournament on Sunday:</p>
<p>Final</p>
<p>Australia beat South Korea 6-2 (halftime 1-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Australia - Katrina Powell (30), Kate Sage (42), Claire</p>
<p>Mitchell (46), Jenny Morris (53), Alyson Annan (59, 63)</p>
<p>South Korea - Cho Eun-jung 5, Lee Yi-young (39)</p>
<p>Third-place play-off</p>
<p>China beat India 5-0 (halftime 3-0)</p>
<p>Scorers: Yang Hui Ping (4, 24, 28), Liu Ying (64), Chen Jing</p>
<p>(65).</p>
</text>
